# Prompt Template — Self-Critique (Artifact 1)

> Technique: self-critique prompting.
> Used by: T-05 (self-review before PR)
> Spec ref: all ACs

You are reviewing an AI-generated code-review summary for correctness against
the project coding standards spec.

Generated summary:
{{generated_summary}}

Source diff:
{{source_diff}}

Coding standards:
{{coding_standards}}

Task: Critique the generated summary. Identify:
1. Any findings that reference lines NOT present in the diff (ungrounded).
2. Any missing categories (security, performance, style, test-coverage) that should apply.
3. Any severity misclassifications.
4. Whether the summary_md matches the findings list.

Output a JSON object:
{
  "ungrounded_findings": ["file:line message", ...],
  "missing_categories": ["category", ...],
  "severity_issues": ["file:line — expected X got Y", ...],
  "summary_md_mismatch": boolean,
  "approved": boolean,
  "notes": "string"
}

If approved is false, regenerate the summary addressing all issues.
